# ── image decoding (system-wide, not just the wallpaper) ───────
# The base profile builds gdk-pixbuf with USE="-jpeg -gif -tiff", so it ships
# loaders for bmp/ico/tga/xpm and nothing anyone actually uses. Every GTK app
# that renders a jpg silently fails to "recognize the image file format" --
# swaybg, thunar thumbnails, image previews.
x11-libs/gdk-pixbuf jpeg gif tiff

# ── wallpaper ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
